        "quote": "(a) Applications and the attached forms are to be completed in full. The applicant shall return the completed application and forms to the Police Department. The Chief of Police shall, after receipt of the completed application, direct that the applicant’s qualifications be investigated. Upon completion of the investigation, the Chief of Police shall approve or disapprove the application. The Chief of Police may, at any time during the approval procedure, seek the advice or recommendations of the City Attorney’s office.",
