        },
        "quote": "(b) The Chief of Police is authorized to promulgate all necessary rules and regulations concerning the review and processing of private security firm, employee, agent or guard applications. The rules and regulations so promulgated shall be with the approval of the City Attorney.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.130:block:1#text",
